From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: B Honey <9922368+Mhsbrian@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ANYBOOK: GKI: x86: Enable AMD IOMMU, pinctrl-amd and AMD ACPI
 platform devices

AMD laptops need three options that are bool and so cannot be vendor
modules:

- CONFIG_AMD_IOMMU: DMA remapping and interrupt remapping on AMD.
  amdxdna (XDNA NPU) and the PSP driver depend on it. The x86 GKI already
  has the Intel equivalent (CONFIG_INTEL_IOMMU=y).
- CONFIG_PINCTRL_AMD: the AMD GPIO controller (AMDI0030). I2C HID
  touchpads and many ACPI events use its interrupts.
- CONFIG_X86_AMD_PLATFORM_DEVICE: adds the AMD IDs (AMDI0010 I2C,
  AMDI0020 UART, ...) to acpi_apd.c so the DesignWare I2C controller
  gets its fixed clock. The Intel counterpart CONFIG_X86_INTEL_LPSS=y is
  already set.

CONFIG_PCI_MSI=y and CONFIG_GPIOLIB=y leave gki_defconfig because AMD_IOMMU
and PINCTRL_AMD select them (savedefconfig output); both stay =y.

AnyBook-local, not in ACK. See docs/kernel.md in the AnyBook repo.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I9589041d721768573d73a61e6a43730849607fa5
---
 arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
index b85976bd3a05..e524a9f5db96 100644
--- a/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/x86/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -59,6 +59,7 @@ CONFIG_PROFILING=y
 CONFIG_RUST=y
 CONFIG_SMP=y
 CONFIG_X86_INTEL_LPSS=y
+CONFIG_X86_AMD_PLATFORM_DEVICE=y
 CONFIG_HYPERVISOR_GUEST=y
 CONFIG_PARAVIRT=y
 CONFIG_PARAVIRT_TIME_ACCOUNTING=y
@@ -322,7 +323,6 @@ CONFIG_NFC=m
 CONFIG_NETDEV_ADDR_LIST_TEST=m
 CONFIG_PCI=y
 CONFIG_PCIEAER=y
-CONFIG_PCI_MSI=y
 CONFIG_PCI_IOV=y
 CONFIG_HOTPLUG_PCI_ACPI=y
 CONFIG_PCIE_DW_PLAT_EP=y
@@ -444,7 +444,7 @@ CONFIG_SPI_MEM=y
 CONFIG_SPI_SLAVE=y
 CONFIG_PTP_1588_CLOCK=m
 # CONFIG_PTP_1588_CLOCK_KVM is not set
-CONFIG_GPIOLIB=y
+CONFIG_PINCTRL_AMD=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_GENERIC_PLATFORM=y
 CONFIG_POWER_SEQUENCING=m
 # CONFIG_HWMON is not set
@@ -580,6 +580,7 @@ CONFIG_VIRTIO_BALLOON=m
 CONFIG_VHOST_VSOCK=y
 CONFIG_STAGING=y
 CONFIG_ASHMEM=y
+CONFIG_AMD_IOMMU=y
 CONFIG_INTEL_IOMMU=y
 CONFIG_IRQ_REMAP=y
 CONFIG_REMOTEPROC=y
